      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Esra gwarukusa buuneeda deaweeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Nehemiyeeda was sugoocheanda haw, ea Esraheeda was ashoohoocheanda ea ng'oorshoocheanda, ea fuga Lawi ghoanaal buuneeda, nea geeyeesha buuneesean, “Eaweecheanji ea ghaydit aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA; adoogiisanyi nea adooyeawdi.” Aba gideaba fuga sean gooyeawda iisiyiiy ng'asheega deaweeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha saawa, “Aweayeena heechea aweayeena, ak ghoayaaji gidariishaat nea ghoaleayi difaayeeda inya nea gooyeasi siida mandeawana; aba gideaba eaweecheanji ea ghaydit aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDEANYA; nea adaghang'udeagwa giiseaneega, aba gideaba hooseaneega NG'UTAMIIDA uurdeang'wa gil.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanung' fuga Lawi ghwasiinda buuneesean, nea gwayeesha, “Asiinda aba gideaba eaweecheanji ea ghaydit adoogiisanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghang'eat buuneesean gaweay heechea gaweay, ak gweagiischi nea gwaleeshi nea ghoadaw gea mandeawana nea geesin ghweelmeeda haw, aba gideaba siinaal ng'asheega sirukusa saawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ghweelmeeda udahabeaschajeega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu eaweedeaba iyeenya ghapka heeda Esraheeda was ng'oorshoocheanda fuga hees bea gweargwa gealga buuneesean, sea ashoohoodiga ea fuga Lawi, ak ghabwatgeat eanaal ng'asheega deaweeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geadaah gideaba geang'waar aba jeeda deaweeda gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA gwarukusa Musa gideaba fuga Israeli deabiidana jeeda udahabeaschajeega ghang'eada ghweelmeeda sheedeaba ispwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geerukwiida nea geataarda aba jeeda mujiinajeega nyaawa sean ea aba jeeda Yerusalemu, “Aweayeena uhuuda heayeeniga ak gooyeadu damealga saytuunajeega, ea saytuunajeega dareabeeta, ea meaghayga, ea miilayga ea geediga hees jea eesina udahabeaschajeega, gawuurji gida ghayi sing'waarda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwarita buuneeda ak gweadu geediga ak gaba nih ding'da uhuudeaba gheanyi gwadeeksa geaw udahabeascheanda, ea seamoonigaaschi ea seamooniga gheeda ASEETA, ea seamooda mida ghuuta beega mida dooshta ea seamooda mida dooshta Efraimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea fuga bwatgeat sean leabu giibaleakta gwasin udahabeaschajeega ak goobiida jeesinga udahabeaschajeega; aba gideaba ghang'eada eawoojiga Yeshuwa was orjeeda Nuni ea ghwahita eaweeda fuga Israeli abeeda miyeesindunu. Ak ghoah hooseaneega haw muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak inyeesa galeagasean, ghang'eada eaweeda madeeda ea ghwahita eaweeda huuydean, ghoasoamwa gitaabooda deaweedeeda ASEETA. Nea geesin ghweelmeeda eawooji ispwa; ak eaweedeaba sis ghabwat geat buuneeda gawuurji gida ghayi nyaashta diigheanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
